sequenceDiagram
  participant Sales
  participant Flask
  participant AI as Proposal Agent
  participant KB as Approved Knowledge/Pricing
  participant DB
  participant Approver
  participant SMTP
  Sales->>Flask: Request proposal draft
  Flask->>AI: Scoped opportunity and task
  AI->>KB: Retrieve approved service/pricing facts
  KB-->>AI: Evidence and source versions
  AI-->>Flask: Structured draft
  Flask->>DB: Save draft and version/hash
  Flask->>Approver: Request approval
  Approver->>Flask: Approve exact version/hash
  Flask->>DB: Record approval
  Sales->>Flask: Send approved proposal
  Flask->>Flask: Re-check hash, permission and recipient
  Flask->>SMTP: Send
  SMTP-->>Flask: Provider acceptance
  Flask->>DB: Record send result
